So let's get right to it then, shall we?

252
00:19:03,065 --> 00:19:05,065
This performer proved they had the most star power

253
00:19:05,065 --> 00:19:07,065
and moved us all the tears.

254
00:19:07,065 --> 00:19:10,065
The accomplished child actor, Light Ozura!

255
00:19:10,065 --> 00:19:12,065
Congratulations! You're the winner!

256
00:19:12,065 --> 00:19:16,565
Well done! Way to go, Light!

257
00:19:33,565 --> 00:19:35,565
Light, where are you?

258
00:19:35,565 --> 00:19:37,565
