You should be proud of yourself, Light!

265
00:20:00,065 --> 00:20:04,565
Did you come to mock me?

266
00:20:04,565 --> 00:20:05,565
I didn't win the contest.

267
00:20:05,565 --> 00:20:07,565
Why would I mock you?

268
00:20:07,565 --> 00:20:09,565
The judges liked your performance better.

269
00:20:09,565 --> 00:20:11,565
That's showbiz for ya.

270
00:20:11,565 --> 00:20:15,565
Besides, I thought you were gonna make a splash on Broadway.

271
00:20:15,565 --> 00:20:18,565
And you're the one that said to never give up, right?

272
00:20:20,565 --> 00:20:22,565
Hey, this is the boys' bathroom.

273
00:20:22,565 --> 00:20:24,065
It's no big deal.

274
00:20:24,065 --> 00:20:26,065
It's only the two of us in here.

275
00:20:28,065 --> 00:20:29,065
No matter what,

276
00:20:29,065 --> 00:20:32,065
I'm always going to twinkle and sparkle.

277
00:20:32,065 --> 00:20:34,065
The girls in Front Shushu will too.

278
00:20:34,065 --> 00:20:37,065
We're going to shine like stars forever.

279
00:20:37,065 --> 00:20:39,065
That's why I'm here today.

280
00:20:39,065 --> 00:20:40,065
I thought if I won the contest

281
00:20:40,065 --> 00:20:43,065
that it would help the group stand out even more.

282
00:20:43,065 --> 00:20:46,065
But Light, you have something I could never have.

283
00:20:46,065 --> 00:20:48,065
Cheer up!

284
00:20:48,065 --> 00:20:48,565
Cheer up!

285
00:20:48,565 --> 00:20:50,565
You have a dream.

286
00:20:50,565 --> 00:20:52,565
And it will come true.

287
00:20:59,565 --> 00:21:01,565
Thanks for the pep talk.

288
00:21:10,565 --> 00:21:13,565
You should drop by Tokyo sometime.

289
00:21:13,565 --> 00:21:16,565
Maybe we'll be able to work on something together.

290
00:21:16,565 --> 00:21:17,565
See ya.

291
00:21:18,065 --> 00:21:19,065
See ya.

292
00:21:19,065 --> 00:21:19,565
See ya.

293
00:21:19,565 --> 00:21:20,065
See ya.

294
00:21:48,065 --> 00:21:49,065
See ya.

295
00:21:49,065 --> 00:21:50,065
See ya.

296
00:21:50,065 --> 00:21:51,065
See ya.

297
00:21:51,065 --> 00:21:52,065
See ya.

298
00:23:25,070 --> 00:23:29,070
Lily here! I hope we can make our dreams come true one day!

299
00:23:29,070 --> 00:23:33,070
All you have to do is work hard and do your best and you'll twinkle like a star!

300
